I've found an issue using chat_google_vertex and chat_google_gemini. Basically, even if the environment variables and service-account-key.json are properly configured, the chat object always trigger the web authentication. 

I think I've found the issue in the  default_google_credentials function, in this part:

```
  if (is_interactive()) {
    return(function() {
      function(req) {
        req_oauth_auth_code(
          req,
          client = gemini_client(),
          auth_url = "https://accounts.google.com/o/oauth2/auth",
          scope = "https://www.googleapis.com/auth/generative-language.retriever"
        )
      }
    })
  }
```
In an interactive session, this code is always triggered even if the credentials are already configured. Removing this I have managed to have the authentication working.

